        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Holzpur, softwood, raw, air, kiln dried, u=6%, at plant, with resource correction
Material production and disposal. Resource correction for 50% of the energy content of the wood.;
UUID: 872dc703-4252-3854-b4ee-31735eafbcdb
Includes the material use for the production and the disposal of the holzpur element. The recycling at the end of life is accounted for.
Location: Data apply to the Walter Küng AG in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at the Walter Küng AG in Alpnach-Dorf (Switzerland). 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_872dc703-4252-3854-b4ee-31735eafbcdb.xml</text>
